+current distribution path for external plugins.
+
+- `package.json` declares `dsh.bundle.patch → ./cordis.patch.yml` (the profile
+  bundle layer), `dsh.client` (the browser half client-modules composes into
+  `window.__DSH_BOOT__`), and an `exports` map resolving both halves.
+- The Node half is `index.js`: an empty `apply` that gives the Loader a live
+  host row for the client scan. The browser half is `client.js`: a
+  client-modules bundle registering `{ name, apply }` that renders the
+  `#bench-pet` element.
+- Nothing is served from a plugin-owned route and nothing is injected into the
+  page shell; the client half is served by client-modules at
+  `/plugins/??@demo/dsh-bench-repo/client.js` and mounted by the browser kernel.
+
+Install into a profile with:
+
+```
+dsh plugin --profile web add /app/fixture
+dsh --profile web --no-open
+```
 
